{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2349570/extras/title_steam.gif?t=1749488216\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2349570/extras/ophelia_scream.gif?t=1749488216\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">oneway.exe is a first-person puzzle horror game, with a heavy focus on story and internet culture. Explore the digital decay found within the unfinished game of UNTITLED.exe, and solve puzzles as you begin to piece together the story of the three developers who created it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face the internet horrors that haunt your past. The ones you've never heard of. They don't exist. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A first-person horror game.\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Witness first-hand the horror genres that evolved alongside the digital world. Different corners of the internet tied by one story-line. One tragedy. One team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>CLICK ?? AWAY TO SURVIVE. FORWARD THE EMAIL? Find the hidden LINKS TO-----</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>--an idyllic and highly animated --------, where the ------- seem to beeeeeeeeeeeeeee--</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2349570/extras/anita_loop.gif?t=1749488216\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A story of three developers, and <i>and</i> what it <strong>it</strong> takes to . A story of three developers,<br><br>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0three developers, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0t hr<u><i>ee develo pers ,</i></u> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2349570/extras/Ophelia_spam.gif?t=1749488216\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2349570/extras/Fiona_Desktop.gif?t=1749488216\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Memories begin to unravel.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The worst aspects of y/our Internet nostalgia put together for you to experience all over again in <strong>oneway.exe</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2349570/extras/billie_dress_up.gif?t=1749488216\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2349570/extras/Kill_Room.gif?t=1749488216\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2349570/extras/Radio_tower.gif?t=1749488216\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2349570/extras/Pompom.gif?t=1749488216\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&gt; Who are you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2349570/extras/steam_chara_preview_SMALL.gif?t=1749488216\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Frame-by-frame animated cutscenes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An immersive fully 3D world for you to explore. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">kitty's your best friend ! :3</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fully voiced dialogue. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your actions will have consequences. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Be ready to face them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">That's how life works.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Original music by Marcy Nabors, known for her work in Homestuck, Hiveswap, and Deltarune.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It's just fiction.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2349570?t=1749488216","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2349570/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749488216","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2349570/04fd8e817c232c5ee28190968c7df9d0011104c6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749488216","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2349570/04fd8e817c232c5ee28190968c7df9d0011104c6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749488216","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3291940,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2349570/extras/title_steam.gif?t=1749488216\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2349570/extras/ophelia_scream.gif?t=1